  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Epidemiological Shield and Sector Reform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Esc. Epidemiolgico y Apoyo Reforma Salud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT COMPRISES TWO MAJOR COMPONENTS: (I) EPIDEMIOLOGICAL SHIELD TO COMBAT ENDEMIC DESEASES (CHAGAS) AND IMPLEMENTATION OF AN EPIDEMIOLOGICAL SURVAILLANCE SYSTEM; AND(II) TECHNICAL SUPPORT FOR HEALTH SECTOR REFORM BY BUILDING INSTITUTIONAL CAPACITY AT THE MINISTRY LEVEL TO CONDUCT THE REFORM PROCESS, PREPARATION OF SECTOR STUDIES TO STRUCTURE THE REFORM, AND IMPLEMENTATION OF FOUR PILOT PROJECTS TO TEST THE NEW SANITARY MODEL BASED ON FAMILY HEALTH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
